                    <run fontcolor='#4d5156' fontsize='11'>€], </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>exluding VAT, paid by the restaurants per order for a specific service (e.g. placement on the portal, domain hosting, delivery etc), among successful orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Delivery Fee: </run>
