                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Successful Orders for Dmarts: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>same as above, for the dmarts vertical.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Seamless Orders:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>  An order is seamless if the following conditions are met:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- The order was own delivery</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
